1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,317
Growers copy plants on purpose.

2
00:00:02,317 --> 00:00:04,778
Cuttings of sugarcane and rose.

3
00:00:04,778 --> 00:00:07,278
Layering in jasmine and litchi.

4
00:00:07,278 --> 00:00:13,971
And grafting: a shoot of the variety you want, the scion, is joined onto a hardy rooted stock.

5
00:00:13,971 --> 00:00:18,033
The apple orchards of Mustang and Jumla are grafted.

